  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">작년 중학교1,2 대상 영재수업때 활용했던 드론관련 수업 자료 공유합니다.<br>45분씩 3차시로 운영<br>&#160;<br>*드론과 관련된 내용을 퀴즈앤으로 학습, 간식보상(^-^)<br><a href=\"https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Easy &amp; Fun 퀴즈앤::My Show\" data-og-description=\"실시간퀴즈 게임러닝 퀴즈 퀴즈문제 Quiz 퀴즈앤 퀴즈엔 quizn 퀴즈게임 퀴즈쇼 실시간퀴즈 라이브퀴즈 게임러닝 마이크로러닝 게이미피케이션 한국형카훗 학습도구 마케팅 이벤트퀴즈 팀빌딩 \" data-og-host=\"quizn.show\" data-og-source-url=\"https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328\" data-og-url=\"https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/3trYf/hyPAqz9sQD/ERxH6TevhqVAZ4nA8Vjea1/img.png?width=587&amp;height=449&amp;face=0_0_587_449\"><a href=\"https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://quizn.show/quz/show/myShowDetail.do?showSeq=141328\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/3trYf/hyPAqz9sQD/ERxH6TevhqVAZ4nA8Vjea1/img.png?width=587&amp;height=449&amp;face=0_0_587_449\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Easy &amp; Fun 퀴즈앤::My Show</p><p class=\"og-desc\">실시간퀴즈 게임러닝 퀴즈 퀴즈문제 Quiz 퀴즈앤 퀴즈엔 quizn 퀴즈게임 퀴즈쇼 실시간퀴즈 라이브퀴즈 게임러닝 마이크로러닝 게이미피케이션 한국형카훗 학습도구 마케팅 이벤트퀴즈 팀빌딩 </p><p class=\"og-host\">quizn.show</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">*ppt수업자료 인쇄 후 배부, 이론 다시 점검하고 플라잉 옥타곤 만들기<br>*영상을 공유하여 영상보며 만들거나, 인쇄물의 제작방법을 보고 차근차근 같이 만들어감<br>*제작 후 드론날려보기, 팀을 나누어 드론 경주하여 간식 보상<br>&#160;<br>*단점 : 예산이 많이 소요됨. 인당 15000원정도(키트 구입-토이디렉터)<br>*장점 : 애들이 만들어본 적 없는 거라 신기해하는 편.<br>*자료는 아래 구글 드라이브에, 글꼴은 메이플스토리<br><br>&#160;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"영재)플라잉옥타곤 - Google Drive\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/oiEHD/dJMb9aKNBff/5F0BRYStooZ16oA1X8lgN1/kakaolink40_original.png?width=48&amp;height=48\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B_vZjD1XOQP8fllOdG1tcmNJdjlhUHNuTWdjaDctc25CWjk2OUJMeW9nVGRqOEVfYVVtSlU?resourcekey=0-SB4aqaTvSfSxxNL_OuawSA\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/oiEHD/dJMb9aKNBff/5F0BRYStooZ16oA1X8lgN1/kakaolink40_original.png?width=48&amp;height=48\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">영재)플라잉옥타곤 - Google Drive</p><p class=\"og-desc\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">drive.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-ali